@HostAddress = http://localhost:9001

# Starta även BankRUs.CreditScoreService (http://localhost:9000) – den hämtar kreditvärdet där.

### Anna (71 i CreditScoreService) → 201 Approved
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19900101-2010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Erik (50 i CreditScoreService) → 201 Approved
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19850515-1234",
  "amount": 50000
}

### Maria (0 i CreditScoreService) → 201 Declined
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19780320-5678",
  "amount": 750000
}

### Okänd kund (404 i CreditScoreService) → 201 Declined
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19990909-0000",
  "amount": 20000
}

### Felaktigt personnummer → 400
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "9001012010",
  "amount": 100000
}

### Belopp 0 → 400
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/loanapplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "socialSecurityNumber": "19900101-2010",
  "amount": 0
}

